  "title": "Biogas in France: TotalEnergies Starts Its 2nd Largest Unit in Normandy",
  "summary": "BioNorrois will produce 153 GWh of biomethane, enough to supply 30,000 inhabitants. The sugar producer Cristal Union will provide up to 80% of the agricultural materials. BioNorrois will also produce 150,000 tons of natural fertilizer per year. BioNorrois will help avoid the emission of 30,000 tons of CO2 per year. Paris, February 26, 2025 – […]",
